                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.51632 National City Bank/35: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in
                        Brazil</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Morgan</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-06-14T13:00:00-04:00">June 14, 1930—1
                    p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>42. Your 33, June 11, 3 p.m., last paragraph. The Secretary spoke with Senhor
                    Freitas Valle this morning regarding the matter emphasizing the desirability of
                    a rapid settlement. Mr. Valle promised to cable to Rio regarding it.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
